<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets Chinese Automobile warrants.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets Chinese Automobile warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Chinese Automobile Corp, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    NT$35.80		  PREMIUM	15.70 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     NT$5.6206		 GEARING	6.37 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 07.NOV.96-15.JUL.97   PAYDATE	07.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  NT$35.80</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
